      "channelId": "UC9ZNrGdT2aAdrNbX78lbNlQ",
      "title": "GopherCon UK 2019: Bernd Rücker - Lost in Transaction?",
      "description": "Consistency gets incredibly hard in today’s architectures as ACID transactions are not available in distributed systems. Most techies are not really aware of the complexity they face. I want to make this transparent but also discuss solution strategies/patterns to survive.",
